    {"id":"session120-row-37","excel_row":38,"review_no":37,"content":"I tried to wear once, fit was huge they were uncomfortable. You get what you pay for. I ended up buying Simms waders and boots from my local Fly Fishing Store","human_issue_labels_zh":["尺码不准"],"human_highlight_labels_zh":[],"human_issue_keys":["size_fit_problem"],"human_highlight_keys":[],"local_current_output":{"issue_keys":["size_fit_problem"],"highlight_keys":[]},"false_positive":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":[]},"false_negative":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":[]},"wrong_aspect":[],"wrong_evidence":[]},
    {"id":"session120-row-38","excel_row":39,"review_no":38,"content":"I did finally get a hole, but it was from my own negligence, i drove my knee into a sharp stick while climbing up a hillside, i dont think any waders would have taken it well. However, the soles are durable and have really good tread, but the feel of them isnt the best, id get some insoles. The pvc is thin but does seem durable as i havent worn the knees or the butt out at all in the time ive had them (6 months or so, frequent river & creek fishing trips from summer into winter). I havent had any leakage until i had a dumby attack not too long ago, and if you layer up and wear your woolies you can still go duck hunting and fishing well into winter, ive used these in temps down to 8°F and been fine with the proper layers to go with, in the summer they arent too bad but you will probably end up sweating a good bit and not realize it till you take them off. Pretty sure sweating and waders go almost hand in hand when its above freezing out. I will say tho, since these are a one size fits all, im a bit smaller than average as far as my frame goes so the shoulder straps are always a little loose, but its not too bad","human_issue_labels_zh":["透气性差"],"human_highlight_labels_zh":["耐用性好"],"human_issue_keys":["not_breathable"],"human_highlight_keys":["holds_up_well"],"local_current_output":{"issue_keys":["not_breathable"],"highlight_keys":["holds_up_well"]},"false_positive":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":[]},"false_negative":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":[]},"wrong_aspect":[],"wrong_evidence":[]},
