    {"id":"session120-row-47","excel_row":48,"review_no":47,"content":"We bought two pair of these so that we could begin to surf fish in the Pacific, where the water is cold.  We simply wear a heavy pair of socks and some long underwear underneath and we stay comfortable in the water.  It's the cold hands that make us want to leave the surf!  I was expecting something of less quality, but after 5+ trips into the ocean with these, I'm very happy.  If they wear out after 1 season, well...  then I guess I'll have to change the review.  ;-)","human_issue_labels_zh":[],"human_highlight_labels_zh":["整体满意"],"human_issue_keys":[],"human_highlight_keys":["overall_satisfied"],"local_current_output":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":["overall_satisfied"]},"false_positive":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":[]},"false_negative":{"issue_keys":[],"highlight_keys":[]},"wrong_aspect":[],"wrong_evidence":[]},
